# FAB feedback hard gate (ALGR)

In-app **Feedback FAB** → Linear issues are **intake only** unless authorized.

## Authorized without a separate chat “approve”

1. User **explicitly approved** that issue in this conversation (or clearly moved it out of review with intent to build).
2. Title or description contains **`-AMK`**.
3. **Owner auto-approve:** submitter matches the **product’s** owner allowlist (see that repo’s `fab-feedback-gate.mdc` overlay) **or** Linear `Approval: auto-approved`.

Always **read and cite the submitter**. Implement only the authorized issue; do not batch other pending non-owner FAB items.

## Gated signals (unless authorized above)

- Title `[Needs Review]` / `[FAB form]` / `[Needs Review & Authorization]`
- Label **Needs Review** (or product equivalent)
- `NEEDS REVIEW …` banner / `Approval: pending`
- `Source: in-app-fab`

## Product overlays

Owner emails/ids, Linear team/project, and deploy targets stay in each product’s `.cursor/rules/fab-feedback-gate.mdc`. Skill: `fab-feedback`.
